---
description: RDE engineering contract pointer
globs: src/rde/**/*.py
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the shipped RDE engineering contracts in
`src/rde/docs/engineering.md`, with science and experiment requirements in
`src/rde/docs/methodology.md`, `src/rde/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, and
`src/rde/docs/experiment-playbook.md`. Detect the machine profile before
backend claims; preserve vectorization, batching, cache, numerical, provenance,
and durable-progress contracts. RDE core defaults to live overall/per-task
progress with elapsed time and ETA, including flushed newline output under
`tee`/CI; use `NullProgress()` only when silence is explicitly required.
